SUMMARY:Free Flow Band
DESCRIPTION:Free Flow Band is coming back for another epic night at Shiloh & Gaines! \nAccording to the Mountain Xpress\, the Free Flow Band members are the “The Guardians of Funk\, and an Irresistible Dance Party that draws fans from across generations and social groups and if you ask their fans\, they will tell you Free Flow is a dance band that doesn’t try to sound like anyone but Free Flow.” Free Flow’s line up of musicians reads like a who’s who of the best Funk Bands ever to grace North Carolina. \nNo Cover! \nShiloh & Gaines – Your neighborhood bar……no matter where you live. \nCoffee ~ Spirits ~ Pool ~ Darts ~ Live Music ~ Dog Friendly ~ Karaoke ~ Songwriters Night & More! Find our music schedule and more at shilohandgaines.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/free-flow-band/
LOCATION:Shiloh & Gaines\, 700 Hendersonville Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28803\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
