SUMMARY:Braelyn
DESCRIPTION:And when you think the night’s winding down\, Braelyn keeps it going from 11PM to 1AM with a late-night acoustic set. A rising local country voice with a knack for storytelling\, it’s the kind of set that pulls you in a little closer and keeps you there.\nDowntown After 5 might wrap up outside\, but this is where the night keeps going.\n  \nThe Best Night Out in Downtown Asheville! | Honky Tonk | Speakeasy | Private Events | Craft Cocktails & Late Night Bites \nFitz and the Wolfe is a cocktail and music venue shaped by the spirit of improvisation\, storytelling\, and the kind of nights that feel too good to end. Here\, every night brings a new soundtrack. Jazz\, swing\, honky-tonk\, and sometimes things a little more esoteric—if it moves people\, we book it. The music fills the space like a second heartbeat\, sometimes rowdy\, sometimes intimate\, always memorable. It’s not background noise. It’s the reason you’re here. fitzandthewolfe.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/fitz-wolf-template-3/
LOCATION:Fitz and the Wolfe\, 1 Battery Park Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-05-14-104305-e1778769998248.png
GEO:35.5954515;-82.5548502
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Fitz and the Wolfe 1 Battery Park Ave Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1 Battery Park Ave:geo:-82.5548502,35.5954515
END:VEVENT
