UID:10062810-1778925600-1778958000@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Soft Opening
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Cotton Mill in the River Arts District is buzzing with creative energy once again! \nOur visual and healing arts studios are all moved in and ready to welcome you for an official first look at our beautifully restored building and creative hub. Come celebrate the beginning of this new chapter with us on Saturday\, May 16th from 10:00am to 7:00pm and enjoy studio tours\, live demonstrations\, a collaborative community art led by @artplaystudionc\, and massage chair and spine checks from @alignasheville\, plus live music w/ Maddy Hendrix from 12-2 and Jennie Bruner from 3-5\, coffee and food trucks throughout the day!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/soft-opening/
LOCATION:Cotton Mill Studios\, 122 Riverside Drive\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
GEO:35.5881327;-82.5689339
